{
  "subtitle.viltrumitecore.reinhard.final_punch.1": "原谅我。我从未以全力战斗过。",
  "subtitle.viltrumitecore.reinhard.final_punch.2": "我一直在克制，好让这个世界保持完整。",
  "subtitle.viltrumitecore.reinhard.final_punch.3": "但今天不会了。",
  "subtitle.viltrumitecore.reinhard.final_punch.4": "我所有的力量、所有的加护——尽在这一拳。",
  "subtitle.viltrumitecore.reinhard.final_punch.5": "听到了吗？世界正屏住呼吸。",
  "subtitle.viltrumitecore.reinhard.final_punch.6": "空气在燃烧。天空在碎裂。",
  "subtitle.viltrumitecore.reinhard.final_punch.7": "别怕。转瞬即逝。",
  "subtitle.viltrumitecore.reinhard.final_punch.8": "这就是……",
  "subtitle.viltrumitecore.reinhard.final_punch.9": "……终结。",
